  "description": "Amp-Trap ATQ midget time-delay fuse rated 500VAC, with ampere ratings from 1/10 to 30A (this part rated 25A). An excellent choice for supplemental protection of circuits where the available short circuit current does not exceed 10,000A (not for branch circuit protection). Time-delay characteristic of 12 seconds at 200 percent of rated current, suited to circuits with high inrush current such as lighting, solenoid, motor and transformer circuits. Ferrule-terminated, midget (10 x 38mm) body, compatible with UltraSafe fuse holders.",
